    "description": "<p>The Macro-Galaxy Explorator Voidsuit is a feature-replete voidsuit, with integrated @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-gear.Item.GY9OebUM3NM9MSqj]{Thrustpack} and robust life support, technological features, and hazard mitigation. It is necessarily cumbersome to accommodate long-term missions in the vacuum of space.</p><p>Grants the user +15 Base HP, +10 DEF, and +5 SPDEF, and reduces their SPD by -40%, while causing them to take -10% less Special-Category damage and gain +25% RES.</p>",
